Agent Screen
============

This plugin includes a fork of DeskPad and a private CoreGraphics
header originally published elsewhere. Credit belongs with those
authors first — Agent Screen is a Hermes companion built on their work.

DeskPad
-------

    Project:   DeskPad
    Author:    Bastian Andelefski (Stengo)
    Source:    https://github.com/Stengo/DeskPad
    License:   MIT License (c) 2022 Bastian Andelefski
               see LICENSE.deskpad in this directory

Forked content (substantial portions of DeskPad):

    - CGVirtualDisplay private-API setup (descriptor, modes, apply)
    - CGDisplayStream → IOSurface → window layer contents
    - click-to-warp the cursor onto the virtual display
    - titlebar highlight while the cursor is on the virtual screen
    - window chrome (transparent titlebar, movable-by-background,
      aspect-ratio lock, terminate-after-last-window)

